module decl_pos_proj

// A DECLARED positional tuple projected by position. The emitter's projection
// door asks `is_tuple`, which answers true only for the ANONYMOUS structural
// shape (TkTuple); this type is TkRecord with the PositionalTuple shape, so it
// would fall to the record path -- and that path spells the member by the leaf's
// text, which here is the digit `0`.
type Pair(int, int)

fn main() {
    ro p = Pair(3, 4)
    println(p.0)
}
